","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov","html_url":"https://github.com/ttyusupov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":7,"created_at":"2019-02-12T20:07:41Z","updated_at":"2019-07-17T11:19:14Z","closed_at":"2019-02-25T15:51:51Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Despite `--memory_limit_hard_bytes 4294967296` (4 GB), Yugabyte 1.1.10.0 community edition can, during Jepsen tests involving network partitions, have a single yb-master process allocate hundreds of gigabytes of ram, eventually causing the box to run out of ram, and processes to start crashing. I don't know yet whether this was specifically triggered by a partition, but I do have a reproduction case for you, if you've got Jepsen available:\r\n\r\n```\r\ngit checkout 2330b2efdeee435943784f95aa3a52b1356a18db\r\nlein run test -o debian --version 1.1.11.0 --concurrency 4n -w single-key-acid --nemesis partition-half --nemesis-interval 20 --nemesis-schedule fixed --time-limit 600 --test-count 10\r\n```\r\n\r\nI know this isn't much to go on, but I do have a [tarball](http://jepsen.io.s3.amazonaws.com/analyses/yugabyte-db-1.1.9/yb-mem-leak.tar.bz2) of the data files on each node. The invocation parameters for yb-master and yb-tserver are in the log directories, in files called `stdout`.","closed_by":{"login":"ttyusupov","id":903044,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwMzA0NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/903044?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov","html_url":"https://github.com/ttyusupov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/862/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/862/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}